/ActualText (1. Workflow Definitions:\(Allow users to create, update, list, and publish workflows made of typed nodes. Workflows should follow a draft \222 publish lifecycle. Published workflows should be frozen and runnable.\(\n2. Webhook and Manual Triggers:\(Support webhook-based triggers protected by a workflow secret, along with manual trigger APIs for testing and demos. The trigger payload becomes the input for the run.\(\n)
/K [7]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 394 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
